on The Act Of Noticing where they were joined by saxophonist Josephine Davies to form the trio Espial.\\n\\nTonight Josephine will open the evening with a short solo set before joining the trio for the second part of their performance. \\n\\nExpect lush impressionism, dark atmospheres, lyrical melodies, intricate textures and intoxicating grooves. \\n\\n“Just gorgeous, pure music. Softly, as in a morning sunrise.” – Darren Bergstein, Downtown Music Gallery NYC\\nReviewing Ripples\\n\\n“Debussy was creating elements of modern jazz decades before it emerged and if he were alive today, one could imagine this is the kind of combo he might put together.” – Dominic Rivron, INTERNATIONAL TIMES”\\nReviewing The Act Of Noticing\\n\\n\\nDiscus Music: discusmusic.bandcamp.com / discus-music.org\\n\\nWe are a large Sheffield based independent label for creative music with over 200 CD/DL releases, curated by Martin Archer. As well as the residency group leaders Martin Archer, Charlotte Keeffe and Martin Pyne, artists on the label include Keith Tippett, Julie Tippetts, Paul Dunmall, Cecil Taylor, Tony Oxley, Pat Thomas, Laura Cole, Let Spin, Das Rad, Orchestra Of The Upper Atmosphere, Uroboro, Stephen Grew, Guy Segers, Corey Mwamba, Robert Mitchell, Alya Al-Sultani, Inclusion Principle, Johnny Hunter, Mick Beck, Billy Marrows, Jan Todd / frostlake, Faith Brackenbury, Tony Bianco, The Exu, Faradena Afifi, Steve Beresford, Paul Khimasia Morgan, Laura Jurd, Keir Cooper, Ron Caines, Matthew Bourne, Chris Sharkey, Carla Diratz, Theo May, Paul Taylor, This Celestial Engine, Fjall, Walt Shaw, Steve Tromans, Rachel Musson, Mark Sanders, James Mainwaring, Ricard Scott, Army Of Briars, Nick Robinson, Michael Bardon, Bo Meson, Juxtavoices, Alex Ward and many more.\\n&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;venues&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,17],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;The Horse Hospital&quot;],&quot;address&quot;:[0,&quot;Colonnade&quot;],&quot;city&quot;:[0,&quot;London&quot;],&quot;country&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;postcode&quot;:[0,&quot;WC1N 1JD&quot;],&quot;capacity&quot;:[0,120],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;The Horse Hospital is an artist-led, not-for-profit independent arts venue in central London.\\n\\nEstablished in 1993 by Roger K. Burton, THH has uplifted countercultural and experimental art across music, performance, film, fashion, and visual art. It has also served as a living archive of countercultural activity and ‘outsider art.’ \\n\\nAs of 2025, The Horse Hospital is run by The Horse Hospital Collective. This collective has been entrusted with the responsibility of continuing, expanding upon and reaffirming The Horse Hospital’s originating vision, with a renewed focus on providing a home for DIY cultural practices. \\n\\nThe THH Collective’s internally-directed programme runs concurrently with usage of the space by wider communities through our Open Access scheme, as well as provision through direct hire. &quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;wheelchair_accessible&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_bathrooms&quot;:[0,false],&quot;hearing_loop&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_parking&quot;:[0,false],&quot;lift_access&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;promoters&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,331],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Discus Music&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;stripe_account_id&quot;:[0,&quot;acct_1Tne7pGr4LHt6OdK&quot;],&quot;ticket_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;listmonk_list_id&quot;:[0,306],&quot;custom_domain&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_billing_promoter&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;ticket_tiers&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,675],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Concession&quot;],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;Special price for unwaged attendees&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,10],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,30],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,0],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,676],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Standard&quot;],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;Standard general admission&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,12.5],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,30],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,0],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,677],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Supporter&quot;],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;A voluntary higher price for those who wish to show additional support for this concert series&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,15],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,30],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,0],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;external_links&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1297],&quot;url&quot;:[0,&quot;https://discusmusic.bandcamp.com/album/trios-218cd-2026&quot;],&quot;display_title&quot;:[0,&quot;Hear latest album&quot;],&quot;is_embedded&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_active&quot;:[0,true],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;2026-07-20T17:05:11.379402Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;2026-07-20T17:05:11.379402Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1298],&quot;url&quot;:[0,&quot;https://discusmusic.bandcamp.com/album/the-act-of-noticing-172cd-2024&quot;],&quot;display_title&quot;:[0,&quot;Hear album feat Josephine Davies&quot;],&quot;is_embedded&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_active&quot;:[0,true],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,1],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;2026-07-20T17:05:11.379402Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;2026-07-20T17:05:11.379402Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;tags&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,23],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;jazz&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,163],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Free improvisation&quot;]}]]]}],&quot;user&quot;:[0]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;TicketForm&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"border border-surface-300 rounded\"><div class=\"text-[color:var(--theme-fg)] text-[1.1rem] font-semibold text-center p-2.5 flex h-full\">Loading ticket options...</div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">The Discus Music residency at the Horse Hospital, Colonnade WC1N 1JD, takes place on the third Sunday of each month throughout 2027, and rotates between three artists on the label:  Hi Res Heart, Right Here Right Now and The Martin Pyne Ensemble.<br /><br />The venue is fully seated.<br /><br />SUNDAY 21st FEBRUARY 2027 – DOORS 7.30 PM<br />MARTIN PYNE'S CHALK HORSES TRIO<br /><br />Martin Pyne – vibraphone / balafon<br />David Beebee – electric piano<br />Angus Bishop - drums<br /><br />+ SUPPORT<br />Josephine Davies – solo saxophone <br /><br />CHALK HORSES TRIO came together to record music which featured on half of Martin Pyne’s new double album TRIOS (Discus). This represents the latest stage in a journey exploring the intersecting sonorities of vibraphone and rhodes piano, which began on Pyne and Beebee’s duo album Ripples, and continued on The Act Of Noticing where they were joined by saxophonist Josephine Davies to form the trio Espial.<br /><br />Tonight Josephine will open the evening with a short solo set before joining the trio for the second part of their performance. <br /><br />Expect lush impressionism, dark atmospheres, lyrical melodies, intricate textures and intoxicating grooves. <br /><br />“Just gorgeous, pure music. Softly, as in a morning sunrise.” – Darren Bergstein, Downtown Music Gallery NYC<br />Reviewing Ripples<br /><br />“Debussy was creating elements of modern jazz decades before it emerged and if he were alive today, one could imagine this is the kind of combo he might put together.” – Dominic Rivron, INTERNATIONAL TIMES”<br />Reviewing The Act Of Noticing<br /><br /><br />Discus Music: discusmusic.bandcamp.com / discus-music.org<br /><br />We are a large Sheffield based independent label for creative music with over 200 CD/DL releases, curated by Martin Archer. As well as the residency group leaders Martin Archer, Charlotte Keeffe and Martin Pyne, artists on the label include Keith Tippett, Julie Tippetts, Paul Dunmall, Cecil Taylor, Tony Oxley, Pat Thomas, Laura Cole, Let Spin, Das Rad, Orchestra Of The Upper Atmosphere, Uroboro, Stephen Grew, Guy Segers, Corey Mwamba, Robert Mitchell, Alya Al-Sultani, Inclusion Principle, Johnny Hunter, Mick Beck, Billy Marrows, Jan Todd / frostlake, Faith Brackenbury, Tony Bianco, The Exu, Faradena Afifi, Steve Beresford, Paul Khimasia Morgan, Laura Jurd, Keir Cooper, Ron Caines, Matthew Bourne, Chris Sharkey, Carla Diratz, Theo May, Paul Taylor, This Celestial Engine, Fjall, Walt Shaw, Steve Tromans, Rachel Musson, Mark Sanders, James Mainwaring, Ricard Scott, Army Of Briars, Nick Robinson, Michael Bardon, Bo Meson, Juxtavoices, Alex Ward and many more.<br /></div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/331\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Discus Music </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"https://discusmusic.bandcamp.com/album/trios-218cd-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Hear latest album </a><a href=\"https://discusmusic.bandcamp.com/album/the-act-of-noticing-172cd-2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Hear album feat Josephine Davies </a> </div>  </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surfa